  "description": "A boy flying a kite for exercise 342. Preserve one child, one airborne kite, a continuous held flying string, trailing tail, and ground. This is a semantic scene, not a scale drawing; no height, change, or result labels are added.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/figures/fig-85.png",
